@startuml organization-agent-boundary
title Organization / Agent Boundary ; per ADR-ES-022 section 6

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as Org
class "Agent" as Ag

Org --> Ag : coordinates
Org -[dotted]- Ag : is NOT
Ag -[dotted]- Org : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 6:
  Organization coordinates Actors, which may include Agents. An
  Organization may contain Agents, but an Organization is NOT
  an Agent.
end note

@enduml
